      "title": "Copper Ingot",
      "category": "materials/1-common/metals/copper-ingot",
      "source": "materials/1-common/metals/copper-ingot/index.md",
      "content": "---\ntitle: Copper Ingot\nslug: copper-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Common\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot\nmaterial_family: Copper\nsource_items:\n  - Copper Ore\nweight: 1kg\nweight_class: Light\ndurability: Low\nenchantment_affinity: \"15% (+1 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 8 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - common\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Copper Ingot\n\n## Effect\nA refined metal with excellent conductivity, Copper Ingots are widely used in crafting tools, enchantment bases, and early-stage equipment.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Used in:\n  - Basic weapons\n  - Magical conduits\n  - Artificer components\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Soft and easily shaped  \n- Low durability under stress  \n- High energy conductivity  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- [[Bronze Ingot]] (with Tin)\n- [[Brass Ingot]] (with Zinc)\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Boosts Fire and Lightning effects  \n- Improves low-tier enchantment stability  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Copper Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Refined from flame, shaped by will.\"*\n"
