      "category": "materials/2-uncommon/metals/cast-iron-ingot",
      "source": "materials/2-uncommon/metals/cast-iron-ingot/index.md",
      "content": "---\ntitle: Cast Iron Ingot\nslug: cast-iron-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Uncommon\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot (Alloy)\nmaterial_family: Cast Iron\nsource_items:\n  - Iron Ingot\n  - Carbon\nweight: 1.6kg\nweight_class: Heavy\ndurability: Moderate\nenchantment_affinity: \"10% (+0 dice)\"\ndamage_modifier: 1\narmor_modifier: 2\nmarket_value: 20 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - uncommon\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Cast Iron Ingot\n\n## Effect\nCast Iron is a dense and rigid alloy that provides strong structural support but suffers from brittleness under stress. It excels in defensive applications but performs poorly in precision weaponry.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Heavy armor\n- Defensive structures\n- Reinforced components\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Excellent at absorbing blunt force  \n- Brittle under sharp or repeated stress  \n- Difficult to reshape once formed  \n- Dense and heavy  \n\n---\n\n## Alloy Composition\n- 1x [[Iron Ingot]]\n- Carbon (high concentration)\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Weak enchantment compatibility  \n- Slight synergy with Earth-aligned effects  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- +1 Damage Modifier (limited use)\n- +2 Armor Modifier\n- Best suited for defensive builds  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires:\n  - 1x [[Iron Ingot]]\n  - Carbon\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Strong enough to stand — until it breaks.\"*\n"
