      "category": "materials/2-uncommon/metals/mercury",
      "source": "materials/2-uncommon/metals/mercury/index.md",
      "content": "---\ntitle: Mercury\nslug: mercury\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Uncommon\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Liquid\nmaterial_family: Mercury\nsource_items: []\nenchantment_affinity: \"35% (+3 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 35 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - uncommon\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Mercury\n\n## Effect\nMercury is a liquid metal that cannot be forged into traditional equipment. Instead, it is used in alchemy, transmutation, and ritual crafting.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Alchemy\n- Rituals\n- Magical infusion\n- Transformation systems\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Liquid state  \n- Highly toxic  \n- Unstable magical resonance  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Enhances transformation and mutation effects  \n- Used in cursebinding and ritual magic  \n- Cannot hold standard enchantments  \n\n---\n\n## Combat Integration\n- Not usable for weapons or armor directly  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"It flows — and nothing that touches it remains unchanged.\"*\n"
