      "content": "---\ntitle: Lead Ore\nslug: lead-ore\ntype: item\nkingdom: Mineral\nitem_class: Common\ncategory: Ore\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ore\nmaterial_family: Lead\nsource_items: []\nrefines_into: Lead Ingot\nrefinement_ratio: \"4:1\"\nweight_class: Heavy\ndurability: Moderate\nenchantment_affinity: \"5% (+0 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 2 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - minerals\n  - metal\n  - ore\n  - common\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Lead Ore\n\n## Effect\nLead Ore absorbs magical energy, making it valuable for anti-magic crafting and containment.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nCalled the *“Veil Stone,”* lead is said to silence magic itself.\n\n---\n\n## Material & Crafting Traits\n- Dense and heavy  \n- Toxic if mishandled  \n- Used in containment crafting  \n\n---\n\n## Refinement\n- Smelts into: [[Lead Ingot]]\n- Ratio: 4 Ore → 1 Ingot\n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- Anti-magic alloys (future)\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Suppresses magic  \n- Blocks magical detection  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Where magic ends, lead remains.\"*\n"
