      "content": "---\ntitle: Silver Ore\nslug: silver-ore\ntype: item\nkingdom: Mineral\nitem_class: Common\ncategory: Ore\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ore\nmaterial_family: Silver\nsource_items: []\nrefines_into: Silver Ingot\nrefinement_ratio: \"4:1\"\nweight_class: Light\ndurability: Moderate\nenchantment_affinity: \"30% (+2 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 6 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - minerals\n  - metal\n  - ore\n  - common\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Silver Ore\n\n## Effect\nSilver Ore carries strong spiritual resonance, making it ideal for crafting anti-entity and divine-aligned materials.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nKnown as *“Moon-Touched Stone,”* silver is said to form where celestial light touches the earth.\n\n---\n\n## Material & Crafting Traits\n- Rare compared to other common metals  \n- High magical purity  \n- Used in sacred crafting  \n\n---\n\n## Refinement\n- Smelts into: [[Silver Ingot]]\n- Ratio: 4 Ore → 1 Ingot\n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- Often combined with stronger metals for weapons\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Strong affinity with Light and Spirit magic  \n- Effective against undead and cursed beings  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Where light lingers, silver forms.\"*\n"
