      "category": "minerals/2-uncommon/ores/aluminum-ore",
      "source": "minerals/2-uncommon/ores/aluminum-ore/index.md",
      "content": "---\ntitle: Aluminum Ore\nslug: aluminum-ore\ntype: item\nkingdom: Mineral\nitem_class: Uncommon\ncategory: Ore\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ore\nmaterial_family: Aluminum\nsource_items: []\nrefines_into: Aluminum Ingot\nrefinement_ratio: \"4:1\"\nweight_class: Very Light\ndurability: Low\nenchantment_affinity: \"25% (+2 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 4 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - minerals\n  - metal\n  - ore\n  - uncommon\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Aluminum Ore\n\n## Effect\nAluminum Ore is unusually light and responsive to energy, making it valuable for crafting materials focused on speed, movement, and agility.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nOften called *“Sky Ore,”* aluminum is believed to form in regions touched by high winds or lightning storms. Ancient artificers sought it to craft tools that defied weight and gravity.\n\n---\n\n## Material & Crafting Traits\n- Extremely lightweight compared to other ores  \n- Difficult to extract without loss due to fragility  \n- Highly resistant to corrosion  \n- Found in high-altitude or storm-rich regions  \n\n---\n\n## Refinement\n- Smelts into: [[Aluminum Ingot]]\n- Ratio: 4 Ore → 1 Ingot\n- Notes: Requires controlled heat to prevent material degradation\n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- Lightweight alloys (future)\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Strong affinity with Air and Lightning magic  \n- Enhances speed and movement-based effects  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Light as wind, fleeting as a storm.\"*\n"
