      "source": "minerals/2-uncommon/ores/chromium-ore/index.md",
      "content": "---\ntitle: Chromium Ore\nslug: chromium-ore\ntype: item\nkingdom: Mineral\nitem_class: Uncommon\ncategory: Ore\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ore\nmaterial_family: Chromium\nsource_items: []\nrefines_into: Chromium Ingot\nrefinement_ratio: \"4:1\"\nweight_class: Medium\ndurability: High\nenchantment_affinity: \"15% (+1 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 6 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - minerals\n  - metal\n  - ore\n  - uncommon\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Chromium Ore\n\n## Effect\nChromium Ore yields a highly stable metal known for its resistance to corrosion and structural reinforcement. It is essential in crafting advanced alloys that require durability and longevity.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nKnown as the *“Shield Vein”* of the earth, chromium was first discovered in mineral deposits untouched by rust or decay. Smiths quickly realised its value — not for power, but for endurance.\n\n---\n\n## Material & Crafting Traits\n- Highly resistant to corrosion and environmental damage  \n- Reinforces structural integrity of alloys  \n- Stable during high-temperature refinement  \n- Often found near iron-rich deposits  \n\n---\n\n## Refinement\n- Smelts into: [[Chromium Ingot]]\n- Ratio: 4 Ore → 1 Ingot\n- Notes: Produces a clean, stable refined metal with minimal impurity loss\n\n---\n\n## Alloy Use\n- [[High Steel Ingot]]\n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Improves durability of enchanted items  \n- Helps prevent degradation under repeated magical use  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"It does not break — it prevents breaking.\"*****\n"
