      "slug": "orichalcum-ore",
      "title": "Orichalcum Ore",
      "category": "minerals/7-legendary/ores/orichalcum-ore",
      "source": "minerals/7-legendary/ores/orichalcum-ore/index.md",
      "content": "---\ntitle: Orichalcum Ore\nslug: orichalcum-ore\ntype: item\nkingdom: Mineral\nitem_class: Legendary\ncategory: Ore\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ore\nmaterial_family: Orichalcum\nsource_items: []\nrefines_into: Orichalcum Ingot\nrefinement_ratio: \"4:1\"\nformation_type: Divine Solar Formation\nweight_class: Medium-Light\ndurability: Extremely High\nenchantment_affinity: \"80% (+6 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 320–500 Marks (Legendary Trade)\ntags:\n  - items\n  - minerals\n  - metal\n  - ore\n  - legendary\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Orichalcum Ore\n\n## Effect\nOrichalcum Ore is a sacred solar metal formed through the fusion of divine heat and celestial mineral deposits. The ore naturally radiates warmth and carries powerful affinity with holy and radiant energies.\n\n---\n\n## Appearance\nOrichalcum Ore appears as luminous golden-red stone threaded with radiant metallic veins. Under sunlight, the veins shimmer softly like molten gold beneath glass.\n\nFragments of the ore emit faint warmth even when removed from active heat.\n\n---\n\n## Lore\nAncient records claim Orichalcum first formed during the Age of Dawn, when divine flame descended into the mortal world and fused with the deep earth.\n\nThe metal became revered among celestial orders and master smiths due to its purity and ability to channel divine energies without corruption.\n\nMany sacred relics and legendary weapons were forged from Orichalcum during the early ages.\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Naturally radiates solar warmth  \n- Highly resistant to corruption and decay  \n- Excellent conductor of holy and radiant energies  \n- Difficult to refine without divine-grade heat  \n\n---\n\n## Refinement\n- Smelts into: [[Orichalcum Ingot]]  \n- Ratio: 4 Ore → 1 Ingot  \n- Requires celestial forge or divine flame conditions  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Strong affinity with **Fire** and **Light**  \n- Enhances:\n  - Holy enchantments  \n  - Radiant effects  \n  - Blessing and purification abilities  \n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"The first light of creation still burns within it.\"*\n"
