      "content": "---\ntitle: Guild Apprentice\ntype: origin\ncategory: City Origin\nvisibility: public\ntags:\n  - origin\n  - guild\n  - craft\n---\n\n# Guild Apprentice\n\n## Overview\nGuild Apprentices were raised or trained around a trade hall, workshop, archive, forge, or professional order.\n\n## Background\nThey understand hierarchy, contracts, tools, and the value of reputation.\n\n## Story Hooks\n- Unfinished apprenticeship\n- Guild rival\n- Master's missing commission\n\n"
