      "content": "---\ntitle: Arcana\ntype: skill\ncategory: Knowledge\nskill_rank: Novice\nprimary_stat: Intellect\nvisibility: public\ntags:\n  - skill\n  - magic\n  - knowledge\n---\n\n# Arcana\n\n## Overview\nArcana covers magical theory, spell structures, ritual patterns, and unusual mana phenomena.\n\n## Checks\nUse Arcana to identify spells, interpret magical markings, and understand arcane effects.\n\n## Training\nArcana begins at Novice unless modified by race, class, origin, or campaign training.\n\n"
